    "@id" : "https://semiceu.github.io/CPSV-AP/releases/3.2.0/"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#priorVersion" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao/0.5.0"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://petriroponen.github.io/kelao-ontology-docs/index-fi.html"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo" : [ {
    "@value" : "0.5.1-core-draft"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Versio 0.4.0 (2026-07-03):\n(1) Aluehierarkia: lisätty transitiivinen yleisominaisuus 'on osa aluetta' (isPartOfArea)\nkäänteisominaisuuksineen (containsArea) sekä sen aliominaisuudet kuuluu maakuntaan\n(belongsToRegion), kuuluu valtioon (belongsToCountry) ja kuuluu työllisyysalueeseen\n(belongsToEmploymentArea). Olemassa oleva kuuluu hyvinvointialueeseen\n(belongsToWellbeingServiceCounty) kytketty saman hierarkian aliominaisuudeksi.\nLisätty luokka Työllisyysalue (EmploymentArea). Lisätty ominaisuusketju\nhasLocation o isPartOfArea -> hasLocation, jolloin sijainti periytyy\naluehierarkiassa ylöspäin. hasLocation-ominaisuuden domain laajennettu\nkattamaan palvelupisteen lisäksi organisaation (unioni).\n(2) Sosiaaliturvan ydinkäsitteet: lisätty luokat Etuuskriteeri (EligibilityCriterion)\noikeusperustaviittauksineen, Asiakas (Customer) roolisuhteineen (roleOfCustomer,\nhasCustomerRole; hakija, käyttäjä ja saaja asiakkaan rooleina), Etuuden saaja\n(Beneficiary), Maksu (Payment), Takaisinperintä (Recovery), Muutoksenhakuelin\n(AppealBody) ja Tulo (Income) ominaisuuksineen.\n"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Versio 0.4.1 (2026-07-05):\nKorjauksia. (1) Määrittelemättömät yläluokat kelao:Agent ja kelao:Entity\nkorvattu prov:Agent- ja prov:Entity-luokilla luokissa Customer, Beneficiary,\nEligibilityCriterion, Income, Payment ja Recovery sekä ominaisuuksien\nhasIncome (domain) ja paymentRecipient (range) osalta; luokkahierarkia on\nnyt yhtenäinen. (2) Poistettu ominaisuuden kelao:alternative päällekkäinen\nowl:DatatypeProperty-deklaraatio (säilytetty owl:AnnotationProperty).\n(3) Erotettu minimumAge- ja maximumAge-ominaisuuksien ruotsinkieliset\nmerkinnät (nedre/övre åldersgräns). (4) Ominaisuuden kelao:amount range\nmuutettu xsd:string -> xsd:decimal. (5) Lisätty owl:AllDisjointClasses\n-aksioomat aluetyypeille ja asiakasrooleille. (6) Versiointimetatiedot\nkorjattu (versionIRI, priorVersion IRI-muotoon). (7) Lisätty\nskos:ConceptScheme-kytkentä luokille BenefitGroup, StatuteType ja\nLifeSituation (owl:hasValue skos:inScheme) todellisiin luokitusdatan\nkaavioihin. (8) Luokka LifeSituationClassification nimetty uudelleen\nLifeSituationiksi: käsite on yksittäinen elämäntilanne, ja luokitus on\nskos:ConceptScheme. Ominaisuuksien isLifeSituationFor (domain) ja\nrelatedToLifeSituation (range) viittaukset päivitetty."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Versio 0.5.0 (2026-09-19):\nMääritelmäkierros. (1) Jokaisella luokalla ja ominaisuudella on skos:definition@fi ja @en; määritelmät noudattavat muotoa \"<yläkäsite>, joka <erottava piirre>\". Luokkien Appeal, AppealBody, Applicant, Application, Beneficiary, Benefit, Decision ja ServiceUnit määritelmät on otettu Kelan terminologisesta sanastosta (v7.1) ja lähde merkitty dcterms:source-viittauksella käsitteen IRI:in; sanastosta johdettuja ovat lisäksi ominaisuudet inhibiting, reducing, paymentRecipient, meansTest, municipalityGroup, residenceRequired, requiresEmploymentHistory, validFrom ja validTo. Ulkoisiin lähteisiin (ELI, PTV, kuntalaki, laki hyvinvointialueesta, laki alueiden kehittämisestä, laki työvoimapalveluiden järjestämisestä) perustuvat määritelmät on merkitty samoin. (2) Määritelmät, joilla ei ole virallista lähdettä, on merkitty skos:editorialNote-huomautuksella tarkistettaviksi käsiteasiantuntijoiden kanssa versiossa 0.6. (3) Annotaatiokäytäntö yhtenäistetty: skos:definition = määritelmä, rdfs:comment = lyhyt käyttöohje; labelia toistaneet kommentit poistettu. (4) Sanastolinkitykset: luokille skos:exactMatch (AppealBody c748, Beneficiary c75, Decision c78, ServiceUnit c862; Appeal skos:closeMatch c741 ja c744); ominaisuuksien skos:exactMatch-linkit käsitteisiin muutettu skos:relatedMatch-suhteiksi, koska ominaisuus ja käsite eivät ole sama asia. (5) Benefit-luokan määritelmästä siirretty verotuksen sanaston määritelmä skos:note-huomautukseksi. (6) relationshipAbbreviation-literaalit tyypitetty xsd:string. (7) Versiointimetatiedot päivitetty. Rakenteellisia muutoksia (luokkien, ominaisuuksien, domainien tai rangejen lisäyksiä tai poistoja) ei tehty; karsintaehdokkaat ja mallinnushavainnot on koottu erilliseen määritelmätyökirjaan versiota 0.6 varten."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Versio 0.5.1 (2026-09-20):\nMääritelmätyökirjan katselmointikierros. (1) Korjattu määritelmiä, lähteitä tai kommentteja: Attachment, BenefitComponent, BenefitGroup, Country, Decision, EligibilityCriterion (lisätty synonyymit), EmploymentArea (epäluotettava lakiviittauslähde poistettu), Location, Municipality, Payment, Region, WellbeingServiceCounty; roleOfCustomer-kommenttia täydennetty; processingTime-kommentti korvattu lopullisella tekstillä. (2) rdfs:domain lisätty 40 datatyyppiominaisuudelle, ja ei-rajoittava, useamman luokan schema:domainIncludes ominaisuuksille amount, postOffice, postalCode ja uuid; toteuttaa määritelmätyökirjan karsintaryhmien katselmoinnin (Huomio #6). (3) Kaikki katselmoinnissa hylätyt karsintaehdokkaat (Päätös = hylkää) poistettiin suoraan vanhentamisen sijaan: karsintaryhmä G2 kokonaisuudessaan -- luokka DataProduct, objektiominaisuudet dataProductOwner ja referenceToBenefit sekä datatyyppiominaisuudet additionalInformation, dataProductId, dataProductKeywords, dataProductType, fileFormat, reportCollection ja responsibleParty -- sekä yhdeksän muuta karsintaryhmien G1 ja G3 ehdokasta (areaType, employmentAreaCode, employmentAreaName, geonamesId, municipalityCode, officeNumber, wellbeingServiceCountyCode, wellbeingServiceCountyName, wikidataId) ja päällekkäinen processingTimeBusinessDays. Kaikki poistetut termit ja niiden poiston syy on kirjattu version 0.6 määritelmätyökirjan \"Poistetut\"-välilehdelle. (4) latitude ja longitude hyväksytty (ei karsita) ja niiden lähteeksi vaihdettu SEMIC Core Location Vocabulary."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Version 0.4.0 (2026-07-03):\n(1) Geographic hierarchy: added the transitive generic property isPartOfArea\nwith inverse containsArea, and its subproperties belongsToRegion,\nbelongsToCountry and belongsToEmploymentArea. The existing property\nbelongsToWellbeingServiceCounty was linked into the same hierarchy as a\nsubproperty. Added class EmploymentArea. Added the property chain\nhasLocation o isPartOfArea -> hasLocation, so that location propagates\nupwards through the area hierarchy. The domain of hasLocation was widened\nto cover both service units and organisations (union).\n(2) Social security core concepts: added classes EligibilityCriterion\n(with legal-basis reference), Customer with role relations (roleOfCustomer,\nhasCustomerRole; applicant, user and beneficiary as customer roles),\nBeneficiary, Payment, Recovery, AppealBody and Income, with their properties.\n"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Version 0.5.0 (2026-09-19):\nDefinition round. (1) Every class and property now has skos:definition@fi and @en in the form \"<genus>, which <differentia>\". Definitions of Appeal, AppealBody, Applicant, Application, Beneficiary, Benefit, Decision and ServiceUnit are taken from the Kela terminological vocabulary (v7.1) with dcterms:source pointing to the concept IRI; the properties inhibiting, reducing, paymentRecipient, meansTest, municipalityGroup, residenceRequired, requiresEmploymentHistory, validFrom and validTo are likewise derived from it. Definitions based on external sources (ELI, PTV, Finnish acts) are marked the same way. (2) Definitions without an authoritative source carry a skos:editorialNote flagging them for review with terminology experts in version 0.6. (3) Annotation practice unified: skos:definition = definition, rdfs:comment = short usage note; comments merely repeating the label were removed. (4) Vocabulary mappings: skos:exactMatch for classes; property-level skos:exactMatch links to concepts changed to skos:relatedMatch. (5) The taxation vocabulary definition moved from Benefit's definition to a skos:note. (6) relationshipAbbreviation literals typed xsd:string. (7) Versioning metadata updated. No structural changes were made; pruning candidates and modelling issues are collected in a separate definition workbook for version 0.6."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Version 0.5.1 (2026-09-20):\nReview round based on the definition workbook. (1) Corrected definitions, sources or comments: Attachment, BenefitComponent, BenefitGroup, Country, Decision, EligibilityCriterion (added synonyms), EmploymentArea (unreliable legal-act source removed), Location, Municipality, Payment, Region, WellbeingServiceCounty; roleOfCustomer comment clarified; processingTime comment resolved into a definitive text. (2) rdfs:domain added to 40 datatype properties, and schema:domainIncludes (non-restrictive, multi-class) added to amount, postOffice, postalCode and uuid, implementing the workbook's pruning-group review (Huomio #6). (3) All pruning candidates rejected in the review (Päätös = hylkää) were removed outright rather than deprecated: the DataProduct group (G2) in full -- class DataProduct, object properties dataProductOwner and referenceToBenefit, and datatype properties additionalInformation, dataProductId, dataProductKeywords, dataProductType, fileFormat, reportCollection and responsibleParty -- together with nine further candidates from groups G1 and G3 (areaType, employmentAreaCode, employmentAreaName, geonamesId, municipalityCode, officeNumber, wellbeingServiceCountyCode, wellbeingServiceCountyName, wikidataId) and the overlapping processingTimeBusinessDays. All removed terms are recorded, with their reason for removal, on the \"Poistetut\" sheet of the version 0.6 definition workbook. (4) latitude and longitude were confirmed (not pruned) and re-sourced to the SEMIC Core Location Vocabulary."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Sosiaaliturvan tietämysgraafi (KELAO) ei sisällä hakijakohtaisia tietoja — henkilötiedot käsitellään Kelan operatiivisissa järjestelmissä."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The Social Security knowledge graph (KELAO) does not contain applicant-level data — personal data is processed in Kela's operational systems."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Appeal",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c741"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c744"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Käytetään sekä oikaisuvaatimuksille että valituksille. Sanastossa muutoksenhaku (c736) on menettely; tämä luokka kuvaa siinä esitettyä vaatimusta."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Appeal"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Muutoksenhaku"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Ändringssökande"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "oikaisuvaatimus"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "valitus"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c741"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c744"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A customer’s demand that a decision issued by an authority or an appeal body be changed, made either as a request for rectification or as an appeal."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Asiakkaan vaatimus viranomaisen tai muutoksenhakuelimen antaman päätöksen muuttamisesta, joka tehdään joko oikaisuvaatimuksena tai valituksena."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Määritelmä on ontologian oma ehdotus; tarkistettava Kelan käsiteasiantuntijoiden kanssa (versio 0.6)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The definition is the ontology’s own proposal; to be reviewed with Kela’s terminology experts (version 0.6)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Appeal"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Muutoksenhaku"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Ändringssökande"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#relatedMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c736"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#AppealBody",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c748"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Appeal body: an organisation handling appeals, e.g. the Social Security Appeal Board (SAMU) or the Insurance Court."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Kelan toiminnassa esimerkiksi sosiaaliturva-asioiden muutoksenhakulautakunta (SAMU), opintotuen muutoksenhakulautakunta, vakuutusoikeus ja hallinto-oikeudet."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Appeal body"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Besvärsinstans"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Muutoksenhakuelin"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Organisation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A body that handles appeals and is external to the authority that issued the decision."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Muutoksenhakuja käsittelevä, päätöksen tehneestä viranomaisesta ulkopuolinen toimielin."
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Organ som behandlar sökande av ändring och är fristående från den myndighet som fattat beslutet."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c748"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Appeal body"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Besvärsinstans"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Muutoksenhakuelin"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Applicant",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c74"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Hakija on asiakkaan prosessirooli (ks. kelao:hasCustomerRole). kelao:User on sovelluksen käyttäjä; sama henkilö voi olla molempia."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Applicant"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Hakija"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Sökande"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Etuudenhakija"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Förmånssökande"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A person or organisation that applies for a benefit."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Henkilö tai organisaatio, joka hakee etuutta."
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Person eller organisation som söker en förmån."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c74"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Applicant"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Hakija"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Sökande"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Hakija on prosessirooli. kelao:User on sovelluksen käyttäjä; sama henkilö voi olla molempia."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Application",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c77"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Hakemuksen vireilletulo käynnistää asian käsittelyn. Käsitteellinen luokka: tietämysgraafi ei sisällä hakijakohtaisia hakemuksia."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Ansökan"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Application"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Hakemus"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Ansökan om förmån"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Etuushakemus"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Förmånsansökan"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A document by which a benefit applicant requests, or a request is made on their behalf and with their consent, to receive a benefit."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Asiakirja, jolla etuudenhakija esittää pyynnön tai hänen puolestaan ja hänen suostumuksellaan esitetään pyyntö saada jotain etuutta."
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Dokument med vilket en förmånssökande anhåller om en förmån eller det på den förmånssökandes vägnar och med hens samtycke anhålls om en förmån."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c77"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Ansökan"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Application"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Hakemus"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Conceptual class only. The KELAO knowledge graph does not contain applicant-level instances — personal data is processed in Kela's operational systems."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Käsitteellinen luokka. KELAO-tietämysgraafi ei sisällä hakijakohtaisia instansseja — henkilötiedot käsitellään Kelan operatiivisissa järjestelmissä."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Attachment",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Kelan MOT-sanakirja"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "An application attachment, e.g. a receipt, certificate or form."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Hakemuksen liite, esim. tosite, todistus tai lomake."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Attachment"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Bilaga"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Liite"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://schema.org/DigitalDocument"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Additional material received from a customer, or material provided to the customer in connection with an outgoing document."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Asiakkaalta vastaanotettu lisämateriaali tai lähtevän asiakirjan yhteydessä asiakkaalle välitettävä lisämateriaali."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Määritelmä on ontologian oma ehdotus; tarkistettava Kelan käsiteasiantuntijoiden kanssa (versio 0.6)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The definition is the ontology’s own proposal; to be reviewed with Kela’s terminology experts (version 0.6)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Attachment"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Bilaga"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Liite"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Liitettä tarvitaan joskus hakemuksen liitteeksi; pakollisuus on hakemus- tai etuuskohtaista (kuvataan SHACLissa, ei luokkatasolla)."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Beneficiary",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c75"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Beneficiary: recipient of a benefit. Distinguished from the applicant: e.g. child benefit is applied for by a guardian, and the payment recipient may be a different party."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Erotetaan hakijasta ja maksunsaajasta: esimerkiksi lapsilisän hakija on huoltaja, ja maksunsaaja voi olla eri taho (esim. kunta tai vuokranantaja)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Beneficiary"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Etuuden saaja"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Förmånstagare"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A person or organisation that receives a benefit."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Henkilö tai organisaatio, joka saa etuutta."
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Person eller organisation som får en förmån."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c75"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Beneficiary"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Etuuden saaja"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Förmånstagare"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Benefit",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c60"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/verotus/c66"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A social security benefit or allowance. General class — use subclasses for instances."
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "FPA:s förmåner är sociala förmåner. Ibland används också termen socialförsäkringsförmåner."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Yleinen luokka. Kelan etuudet ovat sosiaalietuuksia; joskus käytetään myös termiä sosiaaliturvaetuus. Etuus ei aina ole rahamääräinen, mutta sen rahallinen arvo on laskettavissa."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Benefit"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Etuus"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Förmån"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/verotus/c66"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://purl.org/vocab/cpsv#PublicService"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Social benefit"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Sosiaalietuus"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Tuki"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A good whose economic value can be determined and which is granted on the basis of the recipient’s status or life situation according to predefined criteria."
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Nyttighet vars ekonomiska värde kan fastställas och som beviljas utgående från mottagarens ställning eller livssituation på grunder som fastställts i förväg."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Taloudelliselta arvoltaan määriteltävissä oleva hyödyke, joka myönnetään saajan aseman tai elämäntilanteen perusteella ennalta määritellyin perustein."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c60"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Verotuksen sanaston määritelmä: suoritus, joka maksetaan saajan aseman tai elämäntilanteen perusteella ennalta määritellyin perustein (https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/verotus/c66)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Benefit"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Etuus"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Förmån"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#BenefitComponent",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Kelan MOT-sanakirja"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Esimerkiksi opintotuen osia ovat opintoraha, asumislisä ja opintolainan valtiontakaus."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Benefit Component"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Etuuden osa"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Benefit"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#StandaloneBenefit"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "etuusosa"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "sub-benefit"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A separately handled part of a benefit that can be granted only if the benefit of which it is a part has also been granted."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Etuuden erikseen käsiteltävä osa, joka voidaan myöntää vain, jos myös se etuus, jonka osa on kyseessä, on myönnetty."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Esimerkiksi opintotuessa etuuden osia ovat opintoraha, asumislisä ja opintolainan valtiontakaus; lesken- ja lapseneläkkeessä osia ovat perus- ja täydennysmäärät."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "For example, the study grant, housing supplement and government guarantee for student loan are parts of the financial aid for students."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Benefit Component"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Etuuden osa"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#BenefitGroup",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Kelan MOT-sanakirja"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Etuusryhmät ovat skos:Concept-yksilöitä erillisessä luokituksessa (skos:ConceptScheme); yksittäinen etuus liitetään ryhmään ominaisuudella kelao:hasBenefitGroup."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Benefit Group"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Etuusryhmä"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid14"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A group of benefits that share a similar purpose or other defined logical connection, on the basis of which they have been classified as belonging together."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Joukko etuuksia, joilla on samankaltainen tarkoitus tai muu määritelty looginen yhteenkuuluvuus, joiden perusteella ne on luokiteltu kuuluvaksi yhteen."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Määritelmä on ontologian oma ehdotus; tarkistettava Kelan käsiteasiantuntijoiden kanssa (versio 0.6)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The definition is the ontology’s own proposal; to be reviewed with Kela’s terminology experts (version 0.6)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Benefit Group"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Etuusryhmä"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Country",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://termipankki.fi/tepa/fi/haku/valtio"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Käytetään asumisedellytyksen ja rajat ylittävien tilanteiden (EU, ETA, Sveitsi, sosiaaliturvasopimusmaat) kuvaamiseen. Linkitetty schema:Country-luokkaan."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Country"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Stat"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Valtio"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Location"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A sovereign state in whose territory a person resides or works, or whose legislation applies to social security, or a political union that has sovereign legislative power over a defined geographic area."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Itsenäinen valtio, jonka alueella henkilö asuu, työskentelee tai jonka lainsäädäntöä sosiaaliturvaan sovelletaan, tai poliittinen yhteenliittymä, jolla on suvereeni lainsäädäntövalta tietyllä maantieteellisellä alueella."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Määritelmä on ontologian oma ehdotus; tarkistettava Kelan käsiteasiantuntijoiden kanssa (versio 0.6)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The definition is the ontology’s own proposal; to be reviewed with Kela’s terminology experts (version 0.6)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://schema.org/Country"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Country"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Stat"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Valtio"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Lähdeontologiassa kuvattu suoraan schema:Country-luokkana; ydinmallissa määritelty omana luokkana ja linkitetty skos:exactMatch-suhteella."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Customer",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Kelan asiakkuuden käsitemalli (sisäinen lähde)"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Asiakas on pysyvä identiteetti, johon tilannekohtaiset roolit (hakija, käyttäjä, etuudensaaja) kiinnittyvät roolisuhteen kautta (kelao:hasCustomerRole)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Customer: a person or party having a customer relationship with the social security administrator. The customer is the persistent identity to which contextual roles (applicant, user, beneficiary) are attached via the role-of-customer relation."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Asiakas"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Customer"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Kund"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A person or organisation that receives, or may receive, value from a service provided by Kela."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Henkilö tai yhteisö, joka saa tai jolla on mahdollisuus saada arvoa Kelan tarjoamasta palvelusta."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Määritelmä on ontologian oma ehdotus; tarkistettava Kelan käsiteasiantuntijoiden kanssa (versio 0.6)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The definition is the ontology’s own proposal; to be reviewed with Kela’s terminology experts (version 0.6)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Asiakas"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Customer"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Kund"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Asiakkaat voivat olla ulkoisia tai sisäisiä. Asiakkaat voivat olla henkilöasiakkaita tai yhteisöasiakkaita. \n                Kelan asiakas saa joko suoraan tai välillisesti Kelan tarjoamaa palvelua, kuten esimerkiksi Kelan etuutta tai Kelan tuottamaa tietopalvelua. Yleiskielessä asiakkaalla tarkoitetaan toimijaa, joka hankkii tai saa palveluja tai hankkii tuotteita. \n                Tällainen toimija voi olla henkilö, henkilöryhmä tai organisaatio. Eepoksessa käytetään termiä \"customer\" puhuttaessa Kelan henkilöasiakkaista.\n                "
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Decision",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c78"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Päätös etuutta koskevan asian ratkaisemisesta. Etuuspäätös voi olla myönteinen tai kielteinen ja koskea esimerkiksi etuuden myöntämistä, hylkäämistä, tarkistamista, keskeyttämistä, lakkauttamista, maksamista tai takaisinperintää."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Beslut"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Decision"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Päätös"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "beslut om förmån"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "etuuspäätös"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "förmånsbeslut"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A decision resolving a matter concerning a benefit."
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Beslut om avgörande av ett ärende som gäller en förmån."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Päätös etuutta koskevan asian ratkaisemisesta."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c78"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Beslut"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Decision"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Päätös"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#EligibilityCriterion",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Eligibility criterion: an individual condition affecting entitlement to a benefit (e.g. age limit, residence requirement, income limit, employment condition). Reified so that each criterion can carry its own legal basis and parameters."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Esimerkiksi ikäraja, asumisedellytys, tuloraja tai työssäoloehto. Mallinnettu omana luokkana, jotta kriteeri voi kantaa oman oikeusperustansa ja parametrinsa."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Eligibility criterion"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Etuuskriteeri"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "etuusehto"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "etuusperuste"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://data.europa.eu/m8g/Criterion"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A condition for granting a benefit whose fulfilment affects entitlement to the benefit or its amount."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Etuuden myöntämisedellytys, jonka täyttyminen vaikuttaa oikeuteen saada etuus tai etuuden määrään."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Määritelmä on ontologian oma ehdotus; tarkistettava Kelan käsiteasiantuntijoiden kanssa (versio 0.6)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The definition is the ontology’s own proposal; to be reviewed with Kela’s terminology experts (version 0.6)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Eligibility criterion"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Etuuskriteeri"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#EmploymentArea",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Employment area: a statutory area formed by municipalities responsible for organising public employment services (Finnish TE services reform 2025)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Perustuu lakiin työvoimapalveluiden järjestämisestä (380/2023); voimassa 1.1.2025 alkaen."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Employment area"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Sysselsättningsområde"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Työllisyysalue"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Location"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "An area formed by municipalities that is responsible for organising public employment services."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Kuntien muodostama alue, joka vastaa julkisten työvoimapalvelujen järjestämisestä."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Määritelmä on ontologian oma ehdotus; tarkistettava Kelan käsiteasiantuntijoiden kanssa (versio 0.6)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The definition is the ontology’s own proposal; to be reviewed with Kela’s terminology experts (version 0.6)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Employment area"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Sysselsättningsområde"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Työllisyysalue"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Income",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Esimerkiksi palkka, yrittäjätulo, pääomatulo tai etuustulo. Vrt. sanaston käsitteet etuoikeutettu tulo (c72) ja etuusperusteinen tulo (c732)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Income: an income item of a person or recipient unit (e.g. wage, self-employment income, capital income, benefit income) that may be taken into account in means testing."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Income"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Inkomst"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Tulo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "An income item of a person or household that may be taken into account when calculating the amount of a benefit or in means testing."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Henkilön tai ruokakunnan tuloerä, joka voidaan ottaa huomioon etuuden määrää laskettaessa tai tarveharkinnassa."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Määritelmä on ontologian oma ehdotus; tarkistettava Kelan käsiteasiantuntijoiden kanssa (versio 0.6)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The definition is the ontology’s own proposal; to be reviewed with Kela’s terminology experts (version 0.6)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Income"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Inkomst"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Tulo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#relatedMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c72"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c732"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#LegalResource",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#LegalResource"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A work in a legislative corpus. This applies to acts that have been legally enacted (whether or not they are still in force). A legal resource can represent a legal act or any component of a legal act, like an article. Legal resources can be linked together using properties defined in the model."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Vastaa ELI-ontologian LegalResource-luokkaa. Kattaa lait, asetukset ja EU-säädökset riippumatta siitä, ovatko ne voimassa. Säädöksen osat kuvataan luokalla kelao:LegalResourcePart."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Juridisk resurs"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Legal Resource"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Säädös"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#LegalResource"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A statute issued by a public authority and intended to be generally binding, or a version of it."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Julkisen vallan antama, yleisesti noudatettavaksi tarkoitettu säädös tai sen versio."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://schema.org/Legislation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Examples of statutes are acts and decrees as well as legal provisions issued by authorities."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Säädöksiä ovat esimerkiksi lait ja asetukset sekä viranomaisten antamat oikeussäännöt."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Juridisk resurs"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Legal Resource"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Säädös"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#LegalResourcePart",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Esimerkiksi kansaneläkelain 23 §. Erottaa kokonaiset säädökset niiden osista; EU-säädöksissä jaottelu (artikla, kohta) poikkeaa kansallisesta."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Lagdel"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Lain osa"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Legal Resource Part"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#LegalResource"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A structural part of a statute, such as a chapter, section, subsection or paragraph."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Säädöksen rakenteellinen osa, kuten luku, pykälä, momentti tai kohta."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Määritelmä on ontologian oma ehdotus; tarkistettava Kelan käsiteasiantuntijoiden kanssa (versio 0.6)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The definition is the ontology’s own proposal; to be reviewed with Kela’s terminology experts (version 0.6)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Kansaneläkelain 23 §"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Lagdel"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Lain osa"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Legal Resource Part"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#LifeSituation",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A life situation is a phase of change or circumstance in a citizen's life associated with a need for public services and benefits. Individual life situations form the life-situation classification (a skos:ConceptScheme)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Yksittäiset elämäntilanteet muodostavat elämäntilanneluokituksen (skos:ConceptScheme), jonka pohjana on DVV:n elämäntapahtumaluokitus."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Elämäntilanne"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Life Situation"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Livssituation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid15"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A phase or circumstance in a person’s life that involves a need for public services or benefits."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Henkilön elämän vaihe tai tilanne, johon liittyy julkisten palvelujen tai etuuksien tarve."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Määritelmä on ontologian oma ehdotus; tarkistettava Kelan käsiteasiantuntijoiden kanssa (versio 0.6)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The definition is the ontology’s own proposal; to be reviewed with Kela’s terminology experts (version 0.6)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Elämäntilanne"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Life Situation"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Livssituation"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Location",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://semiceu.github.io/Core-Location-Vocabulary/releases/2.1.1/"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A geographic area used e.g. to describe a place of residence, a service operating area, or the location of a service unit. Superclass for municipalities, wellbeing service counties, regions and countries."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Yliluokka kunnille, hyvinvointialueille, maakunnille, työllisyysalueille ja valtioille. Linkitetty W3C Location Core -sanastoon (locn:Location)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Location"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Plats"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Sijainti"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Geographic Area"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Maantieteellinen alue"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Place"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/ns/locn#Location"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A geographic area regardless of its size or administrative level."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Maantieteellinen alue koosta tai hallinnollisesta tasosta riippumatta."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Määritelmä on ontologian oma ehdotus; tarkistettava Kelan käsiteasiantuntijoiden kanssa (versio 0.6)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The definition is the ontology’s own proposal; to be reviewed with Kela’s terminology experts (version 0.6)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Location"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Plats"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Sijainti"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Ydinmallissa nimi on harmonisoitu Location-muotoon ja linkitetty W3C Location Core -sanastoon (locn:Location)."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Municipality",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://valter.sanakirja.fi/all/all/kunta"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Suomen kunnat tunnistetaan kolminumeroisella kuntakoodilla. Kunta kuuluu maakuntaan ja hyvinvointialueeseen."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Kommun"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Kunta"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Municipality"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Location"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A local self-governing unit that performs the tasks belonging to its residents’ self-government and those laid down by law."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Alueellinen itsehallintoyksikkö, joka hoitaa asukkaidensa itsehallintoon kuuluvat ja laissa säädetyt tehtävät."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Kommun"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Kunta"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Municipality"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Suomen kunnat, Suomi.fi URI:t."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Organisation",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://iri.suomi.fi/model/suomiptv2/"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Kattaa julkisen, yksityisen ja kolmannen sektorin toimijat. Vastaa PTV:n ja schema.orgin Organization-käsitettä; EU Core Public Organisation on erikoistapaus."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Organisaatio"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Organisation"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Organization"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/ns/org#Organization"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broadMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://data.europa.eu/m8g/PublicOrganisation"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Organization"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "An association of persons with a common goal and an appropriate structure."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Henkilöiden muodostama yhteenliittymä, jolla on yhteinen tavoite ja tarkoituksenmukainen rakenne."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://iri.suomi.fi/model/suomiptv2/Organization"
  }, {
    "@id" : "http://schema.org/Organization"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Organisaatio"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Organisation"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Organization"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "KELAO-kontekstissa vastaa PTV:n Organization-käsitettä ja \n        schema.org/Organization-käsitettä. Käytetään kuvaamaan kaikkia \n         toimijaorganisaatioita sektorirajat ylittäen (julkinen, yksityinen, \n         kolmas sektori). EU Core Public Organisation on tämän erikoistapaus."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Payment",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Kelan MOT-sanasto"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Kytkee päätöksen, etuuden ja maksunsaajan rahavirtaan. Maksunsaaja ei aina ole sama kuin etuudensaaja (sanasto c76). Maksu, joka perustuu etuuspäätöksessä syntyviin maksutietoihin."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Payment or instalment: a benefit disbursement made on the basis of a decision. Links the decision, benefit and recipient to the money flow. A payment based on the payment data generated by the benefit decision."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Betalning"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Maksu"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Payment"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A benefit disbursement, or an instalment of it, paid to the payee on the basis of a benefit decision."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Etuuspäätöksen perusteella maksunsaajalle maksettu etuussuoritus tai sen maksuerä."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Määritelmä on ontologian oma ehdotus; tarkistettava Kelan käsiteasiantuntijoiden kanssa (versio 0.6)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The definition is the ontology’s own proposal; to be reviewed with Kela’s terminology experts (version 0.6)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Betalning"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Maksu"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Payment"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#relatedMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c76"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Recovery",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Recovery: reclaiming a benefit paid in excess or without grounds from the recipient."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Takaisinperinnästä annetaan etuuspäätös. Kohdistuu maksuun (kelao:recoveryConcerns)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Recovery"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Takaisinperintä"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Återkrav"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Claim for recovery"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A procedure by which a benefit paid in excess or without grounds is reclaimed."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Menettely, jossa liikaa tai perusteetta maksettu etuus peritään takaisin."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Määritelmä on ontologian oma ehdotus; tarkistettava Kelan käsiteasiantuntijoiden kanssa (versio 0.6)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The definition is the ontology’s own proposal; to be reviewed with Kela’s terminology experts (version 0.6)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Recovery"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Takaisinperintä"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Återkrav"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Region",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://stat.fi/meta/kas/maakunta.html"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Suomessa 19 maakuntaa (2025). Rinnakkainen hierarkia hyvinvointialueiden kanssa: kunta kuuluu sekä maakuntaan että hyvinvointialueeseen."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Landskap"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Maakunta"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Region"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Location"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "An area formed by municipalities that serves as the unit for regional development and regional land-use planning."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Kuntien muodostama alue, joka toimii alueiden kehittämisen ja maakuntakaavoituksen yksikkönä."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Landskap"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Maakunta"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Region"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Service",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://iri.suomi.fi/model/suomiptv2/"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A social-security-related service, e.g. an application or advisory service."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Sosiaaliturvaan liittyvä palvelu, esimerkiksi hakemus- tai neuvontapalvelu. Palvelu liitetään etuuteen (kelao:relatedService) ja on käytettävissä palvelukanavien kautta."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Palvelu"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Service"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Tjänst"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://purl.org/vocab/cpsv#PublicService"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "An activity by which a service provider meets a customer’s need."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Toiminto, jolla palveluntuottaja vastaa asiakkaan tarpeeseen."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://iri.suomi.fi/model/suomiptv2/Service"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Palvelu"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Service"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Tjänst"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "In the core model a service is linked to a benefit (kelao:relatedService) and is accessible through service channels (kelao:hasServiceChannel). Service channels (kelao:ServiceChannel) and service units (kelao:ServiceUnit) are part of the core model; broader PTV metadata (e.g. funding type, service classification, target groups) remains outside it."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Ydinmallissa palvelu liitetään etuuteen (kelao:relatedService) ja se on käytettävissä palvelukanavien kautta (kelao:hasServiceChannel). Palvelukanava (kelao:ServiceChannel) ja palvelupiste (kelao:ServiceUnit) kuuluvat ydinmalliin; laajempi PTV-metatieto (esim. rahoitustyyppi, palveluluokitus, kohderyhmät) jää edelleen ydinmallin ulkopuolelle."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#ServiceChannel",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://iri.suomi.fi/model/suomiptv2/"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A service channel: the way a customer accesses a service, e.g. e-service, web page, printable form, telephone service or a physical service point. A single service may have several alternative or sequential channels."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Esimerkiksi verkkoasiointi, puhelinpalvelu, tulostettava lomake tai palvelupiste. Linkitetty PTV:n ServiceChannel-käsitteeseen skos:closeMatch-suhteella."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Palvelukanava"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Service Channel"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Servicekanal"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://iri.suomi.fi/model/suomiptv2/ServiceChannel"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Tapa, jolla asiakas saa palvelun käyttöönsä."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The way in which a customer accesses a service."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Palvelukanava"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Service Channel"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Servicekanal"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#relatedMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c860"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Linkitetty PTV:n ServiceChannel-käsitteeseen vain skos:closeMatch-suhteella, koska ptv: on epävakaa nimiavaruus."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#ServiceUnit",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c862"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A service unit (service point) with a physical location. Service unit data has been combined from Kela's internal sources and PTV service-channel data (entity matching)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Palvelukanavan erikoistapaus, jolla on fyysinen sijainti. Kelan palvelupisteissä työskentelee Kelan palveluasiantuntijoita."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Palvelupiste"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Service Unit"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Serviceställe"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#ServiceChannel"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Palveluyksikkö"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://iri.suomi.fi/model/suomiptv2/ServiceChannel"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A physical service point maintained, as a rule, by one actor where services of that actor or other actors are available."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Toimipiste, jota ylläpitää pääsääntöisesti yksi toimija ja jossa voi saada kyseisen toimijan tai muiden toimijoiden tarjoamia palveluja."
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Verksamhetsställe, som i regel har en aktör som huvudman och där aktören i fråga erbjuder tjänster."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c862"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Palvelupiste"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Service Unit"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Serviceställe"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Palvelupiste on palvelukanavan erikoistapaus, siksi rdfs:subClassOf kelao:ServiceChannel."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#StandaloneBenefit",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Huom. termi \"itsenäinen etuus\" tarkoittaa sanastossa ja EU-asetuksessa 883/2004 eri asiaa (itsenäinen eläke, c535). Nimeäminen tarkistettava versiossa 0.6."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Itsenäinen etuus"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Standalone Benefit"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Benefit"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A benefit that can be granted on its own and may consist of benefit components."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Etuus, joka voidaan myöntää sellaisenaan ja joka voi koostua etuuden osista."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Määritelmä on ontologian oma ehdotus; tarkistettava Kelan käsiteasiantuntijoiden kanssa (versio 0.6)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The definition is the ontology’s own proposal; to be reviewed with Kela’s terminology experts (version 0.6)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Itsenäinen etuus"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Standalone Benefit"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#StatuteType",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Esimerkiksi laki, valtioneuvoston asetus, EU-asetus tai sopimus. Lajit ovat skos:Concept-yksilöitä erillisessä luokituksessa (luonnos)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Statute type classification (draft). The Skos-classification has 13 classes for example EU regulation, Decree, Agreement, Government decree, and Presidential decree."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Författningstyp"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Statute Type"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Säädöstyyppi"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
  }, {
    "@id" : "_:genid16"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Säädöksen laji sen antajan ja oikeudellisen aseman mukaan."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The kind of a statute according to its issuer and legal status."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Määritelmä on ontologian oma ehdotus; tarkistettava Kelan käsiteasiantuntijoiden kanssa (versio 0.6)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The definition is the ontology’s own proposal; to be reviewed with Kela’s terminology experts (version 0.6)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Författningstyp"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Statute Type"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Säädöstyyppi"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#User",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Application user, user."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Käyttäjä on asiakkaan rooli (kelao:hasCustomerRole). Erotetaan hakijasta: käyttäjä voi selvittää oikeuttaan etuuteen jättämättä hakemusta."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Användare"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Käyttäjä"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "User"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A person who uses an electronic transaction or information service of social security."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Henkilö, joka käyttää sosiaaliturvan sähköistä asiointi- tai tietopalvelua."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Määritelmä on ontologian oma ehdotus; tarkistettava Kelan käsiteasiantuntijoiden kanssa (versio 0.6)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The definition is the ontology’s own proposal; to be reviewed with Kela’s terminology experts (version 0.6)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Användare"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Käyttäjä"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "User"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#relatedMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/kela/c859"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#WellbeingServiceCounty",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://valter.sanakirja.fi/all/all/hyvinvointialue"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "21 hyvinvointialuetta sekä Helsingin kaupunki, joka hoitaa hyvinvointialueen tehtävät. Kunta kuuluu täsmälleen yhteen hyvinvointialueeseen."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Hyvinvointialue"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Välfärdsområde"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Wellbeing Service County"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Location"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A public-law entity with self-government in its territory that is responsible for organising health, social and rescue services."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Julkisoikeudellinen yhteisö, jolla on alueellaan itsehallinto ja joka vastaa sosiaali- ja terveydenhuollon sekä pelastustoimen järjestämisestä."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Hyvinvointialue"
  }, {
    "@language" : "sv",
    "@value" : "Välfärdsområde"
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Wellbeing Service County"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#abbreviation",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Internal abbreviation used by Kela for the benefit."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Kelan sisäisesti käyttämä etuuden lyhenne"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Benefit"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "abbreviation"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "lyhenne"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Abbreviation of a benefit used internally by Kela."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Etuuden lyhenne, jota Kela käyttää sisäisesti."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Määritelmä on ontologian oma ehdotus; tarkistettava Kelan käsiteasiantuntijoiden kanssa (versio 0.6)."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The definition is the ontology’s own proposal; to be reviewed with Kela’s terminology experts (version 0.6)."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "abbreviation"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "lyhenne"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#advancePayment",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Käytetään etuuksien välisen ennakkosuoritussuhteen kuvaamiseen. Käyttöala tarkistettava."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Benefit"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "advance payment"
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "ennakkosuoritus"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://kela.fi/ontology/kelao#Benefit"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Relation stating that a benefit may be paid as an advance for the waiting period of another benefit."
  }, {
    "@language" : "fi",
    "@value" : "Suhde, joka ilmaisee, että etuutta voidaan maksaa ennakkona toisen etuuden odotusajalta."
  } ],
